cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UniqKache in research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "UniqKache: A Research Framework for Adaptive KV-Cache Management in Long-Context LLM Inference"
abstract: >-
  UniqKache is an open-source research framework for studying how inference-time
  memory should be managed for long-context large language model inference. It
  provides a correct, policy-agnostic KV-cache abstraction, reproductions of
  established cache policies, a reproducible benchmark harness that reports
  memory, latency and quality together, and infrastructure for contributor-driven
  experiments. The project deliberately separates reproduced prior work from
  engineering improvements and unvalidated research hypotheses.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "UniqKache contributors"
version: "0.0.1"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
license: "Apache-2.0"
